;
; How Cupel files a model's tree in MYRA (cupel_rules.h CR6): under the
; model, its molecule and the atom's place in the model, the atom's
; element (its atomic number) and its position, x, y and z in 1/scale of
; a length unit. Cupel asks whether the numbers fit before it saves a
; model.
^ZXCUPEL(model:i2, molecule:i4, atom:i3) = element:i3! ^ x:i7! ^ y:i7! ^ z:i7!
